All,

This is a reminder of our virtual short course <https://r-nimble.org/nimble-virtual-short-course-january-4-6-2023>, to be held the first week of January. There are still spots available.

We recently added support for automatic differentiation to NIMBLE in a beta release <https://r-nimble.org/beta-version-of-nimble-with-automatic-differentiation-including-hmc-sampling-and-laplace-approximation>, and the workshop will cover these new AD capabilities (and our new Hamiltonian Monte Carlo sampler and Laplace approximation) in detail.

You can register here <https://forms.gle/8NuUcDJtMUGxCHv78>.

-Chris

